  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Choose an uncommon simple, martial or advanced weapon from another ancestry with a trait corresponding to that ancestry (such as loupain, vesperan, or avekiri) or from a culture corresponding to a region that is not yours (such as Mann, Rodda, or Rogalia). You gain access and become familiar with that weapon. For determining your proficiency, a martial weapon is a simple weapon, and an advanced weapon is a martial weapon.</span></p><p>At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</p>"
